WEBVTT

01:40.110 --> 01:42.979
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.210 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 19]

02:19.510 --> 02:22.140
Previously, how many demons

02:22.550 --> 02:25.880
have died in this steel cage smeared with the beast's blood?

02:27.070 --> 02:28.240
You are angry

02:29.820 --> 02:32.430
because you saw that I have everything,

02:34.060 --> 02:36.090
but you have nothing.

02:37.780 --> 02:39.090
That's right.

02:40.800 --> 02:42.680
You're the reason

02:44.670 --> 02:46.730
I have nothing.

02:53.620 --> 02:55.220
You killed so many people.

03:21.030 --> 03:22.310
How dare you

03:25.930 --> 03:28.450
hurt me for the sake of

03:28.540 --> 03:30.329
humans who killed us demons?

03:31.100 --> 03:33.960
The ones who hurt demons are the people in prison.

03:36.230 --> 03:39.090
These people here, who are suffering from illness,

03:40.640 --> 03:42.890
are just here to seek medical treatment.

03:42.890 --> 03:44.220
Humans are all the same.

03:45.220 --> 03:46.680
They hate demons

03:48.030 --> 03:49.410
and despise demons.

03:50.050 --> 03:50.950
Li Lun.

03:52.690 --> 03:54.140
You're wrong.

03:54.790 --> 03:56.660
You're the one who's wrong.

03:59.770 --> 04:01.170
Zhao Yuanzhou.

04:02.010 --> 04:06.380
You betrayed the oath to protect the Wilderness first.

04:07.760 --> 04:10.190
I've never betrayed the oath.

04:11.650 --> 04:14.710
It's just that we protect the Wilderness differently.

04:15.700 --> 04:16.959
Even up till now,

04:18.120 --> 04:19.720
you still don't understand.

04:21.040 --> 04:22.240
Zhao Yuanzhou.

04:23.650 --> 04:26.250
Don't think you're really a human

04:27.200 --> 04:29.200
just because you have a mortal name.

04:30.780 --> 04:32.330
You treat them as friends.

04:33.130 --> 04:35.590
But do they really treat you like one of them?

04:39.110 --> 04:39.909
Of course.

04:40.909 --> 04:42.110
Zhao Yuanzhou

04:42.560 --> 04:44.060
is my best friend.

04:46.909 --> 04:49.040
He's trying to sow discord between us.

04:50.080 --> 04:51.530
Don't listen to him.

04:52.950 --> 04:54.150
I used to be

04:55.980 --> 04:57.740
his best friend too.

05:01.820 --> 05:03.140
Zhao Yuanzhou.

05:05.040 --> 05:06.760
You are invincible.

05:08.560 --> 05:11.290
Why do you want to be friends with these nobodies?

05:12.630 --> 05:14.140
You wouldn't understand.

05:20.320 --> 05:22.270
This Little Bunny may be a crybaby,

05:22.650 --> 05:24.850
but he always risked his life

05:24.970 --> 05:26.830
as we went through thick and thin.

05:27.700 --> 05:29.300
We've been in this together.

05:30.470 --> 05:33.050
Pei Sijing may look cold,

05:34.000 --> 05:35.840
but she's tough on the outside and soft on the inside,

05:35.840 --> 05:38.170
and has well-defined likes and dislikes.

05:38.680 --> 05:39.630
Thank you.

05:40.659 --> 05:42.000
As for Zhuo Yichen,

05:45.350 --> 05:46.880
I don't want to flatter him,

05:47.350 --> 05:48.840
but he is indeed

05:49.230 --> 05:50.630
a dignified gentleman

05:51.180 --> 05:52.520
with a righteous heart.

05:53.060 --> 05:54.520
He has an unbreakable will

05:55.570 --> 05:57.430
and a character as strong as gold.

05:59.490 --> 06:00.750
As for Wen Xiao,

06:01.510 --> 06:04.110
when everyone was treating me as an evil demon

06:05.390 --> 06:06.390
and had feared me,

06:07.640 --> 06:08.520
hated me,

06:10.060 --> 06:11.550
or respected me,

06:14.750 --> 06:15.810
she was the only one

06:16.970 --> 06:20.020
who still looked at me with warmth and sympathy.

06:20.060 --> 06:20.870
Zhuo,

06:22.360 --> 06:24.090
this isn't his true intention.

06:24.210 --> 06:26.670
He's being controlled by malicious energy.

06:28.240 --> 06:29.220
Li Lun.

06:31.400 --> 06:32.790
After all these years,

06:34.620 --> 06:36.620
you still don't understand.

06:38.350 --> 06:39.770
Okay.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.030
Fine.

06:47.520 --> 06:49.840
Since you value them so much,

06:52.310 --> 06:54.860
I'll let you witness

06:55.210 --> 06:56.940
your most precious friends

06:56.980 --> 06:58.460
die one by one.

07:00.630 --> 07:02.790
Didn't you say I have nothing?

07:05.310 --> 07:06.390
Don't worry.

07:08.070 --> 07:09.320
Soon,

07:12.060 --> 07:13.960
you will be just like me.

07:18.270 --> 07:19.180
Let him go!

07:19.460 --> 07:21.170
He's the first one.

07:25.580 --> 07:26.450
Jiu!

07:44.870 --> 07:45.870
What is this?

07:46.800 --> 07:47.659
Divine power.

07:48.710 --> 07:49.630
Divine power?

07:50.640 --> 07:52.730
Why would Jiu possess divine power?

07:55.640 --> 07:57.790
I've underestimated you.

08:01.940 --> 08:03.270
But...

08:04.540 --> 08:07.600
this is indeed a great gift.

08:13.070 --> 08:13.680
Take it.

08:13.950 --> 08:14.730
Pei Sijing.

08:14.760 --> 08:15.600
Zhuo.

08:15.620 --> 08:17.080
Quick, get Jiu out of here.

08:19.630 --> 08:20.350
Jiu.

08:45.870 --> 08:46.890
Zhuo Yichen!

08:53.350 --> 08:53.950
Jiu!

08:55.290 --> 08:55.880
Jiu!

08:59.720 --> 09:01.980
Have you found Yao Water and Divine Wood?

09:04.840 --> 09:05.660
Shut up!

09:12.700 --> 09:13.780
Wen Xiao!

09:19.000 --> 09:20.230
Zhao Yuanzhou.

09:21.560 --> 09:23.920
It seems that Baize Goddess

09:23.950 --> 09:26.300
is deeply in love with you.

09:27.830 --> 09:29.680
She blocked

09:30.200 --> 09:31.960
all of the curse.

10:41.500 --> 10:44.620
If Baize’s blood runs out,

10:46.460 --> 10:47.980
will there still be

10:50.270 --> 10:53.550
another Baize Goddess?

11:06.230 --> 11:07.860
The game is not over yet.

11:08.960 --> 11:11.020
This time it's one or the other again.

11:12.660 --> 11:13.870
Zhao Yuanzhou.

11:15.040 --> 11:16.700
Who will you choose this time?

11:18.410 --> 11:19.810
No need for him to choose.

11:20.280 --> 11:21.340
I'll choose first.

11:22.080 --> 11:22.900
Oh?

11:23.570 --> 11:25.340
I choose for you to die.

11:29.020 --> 11:29.900
Wen Xiao!

11:54.760 --> 11:55.840
Stay here.

11:55.860 --> 11:57.260
I'll go help Zhuo Yichen.

11:57.510 --> 11:58.140
Okay.

12:31.350 --> 12:33.480
I didn't expect the umbrella I gave you

12:34.990 --> 12:37.420
would end up pointing at me.

12:39.510 --> 12:41.800
That's why we never give our good friends

12:42.240 --> 12:43.970
umbrellas in the mortal world.

12:44.780 --> 12:46.110
Because umbrellas mean

12:46.730 --> 12:48.060
to go our separate ways.

12:48.810 --> 12:50.380
You chose the umbrella.

12:51.430 --> 12:52.830
It's also your own choice

12:53.670 --> 12:55.580
to go our separate ways.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.020
Malicious energy?

13:46.960 --> 13:48.600
Zhao Yuanzhou.

13:50.630 --> 13:53.840
You're willing to go this far for them.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.520
Li Lun.

13:57.460 --> 14:00.590
Haven't you wanted me to settle my blood debts all along?

14:01.220 --> 14:01.990
How is this?

14:02.650 --> 14:04.510
I now carry blood with malicious energy.

14:04.510 --> 14:05.910
Isn't that great?

14:55.130 --> 14:56.380
Stop!

14:59.230 --> 14:59.910
Wen Xiao!

15:36.180 --> 15:36.950
Li Lun?

15:38.420 --> 15:39.510
That's right.

15:41.550 --> 15:43.230
As you can see,

15:44.450 --> 15:46.160
I am who I am today

15:47.090 --> 15:49.360
because of you.

15:49.610 --> 15:51.380
Back then, the Ever-Burning Wood

15:51.380 --> 15:53.420
had already entered your body.

15:54.320 --> 15:57.760
Your skills also carried the power of the Ever-Burning Wood

15:58.670 --> 16:00.550
and had hurt me too.

16:08.240 --> 16:09.320
At that time,

16:11.640 --> 16:12.930
I didn't know...

16:16.350 --> 16:17.610
Ever-Burning Wood...

16:19.290 --> 16:20.450
The Ever-Burning Wood

16:20.450 --> 16:21.870
is a sacred wood

16:21.870 --> 16:23.940
that grows in the Wilderness.

16:24.630 --> 16:26.190
It won't die out even during storms,

16:26.190 --> 16:27.660
and its fire never ceases.

16:29.310 --> 16:31.500
Burns from the Ever-Burning Wood

16:32.820 --> 16:34.420
is incurable.

16:37.390 --> 16:39.660
You gave me agony

16:39.660 --> 16:41.870
that I can never recover from.

16:45.270 --> 16:46.070
Li Lun.

16:49.810 --> 16:52.740
I didn't mean to hurt you with the Ever-Burning Wood.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.070
It's my fault.

17:02.710 --> 17:05.490
Li Lun has taken so many lives in the mortal world.

17:06.030 --> 17:07.359
His sins are plentiful.

17:07.650 --> 17:09.690
We must seal him forever.

17:10.579 --> 17:12.440
Back then, Li Lun and I

17:12.839 --> 17:15.440
used magic to rebuild the White Emperor Tower,

17:16.089 --> 17:18.589
and we swore to protect the Wilderness.

17:19.060 --> 17:20.760
His love for the Wilderness

17:21.190 --> 17:22.750
is deeper than anyone else.

17:23.800 --> 17:25.400
But fate played a cruel joke.

17:26.060 --> 17:28.640
Both of you were scalded by the Ever-Burning Wood,

17:28.640 --> 17:31.740
with you as the vessel of malicious energy,

17:32.390 --> 17:35.790
and him, who was most afraid of being scalded as a locust tree.

17:36.000 --> 17:38.020
Even if I don't punish Li Lun,

17:38.350 --> 17:40.490
he will burn to ashes

17:40.710 --> 17:42.520
because of the Ever-Burning Wood

17:42.520 --> 17:43.940
and eventually perish.

17:44.460 --> 17:47.300
Therefore, he was imprisoned at the Place of Birth.

17:47.300 --> 17:48.470
Although to him,

17:48.470 --> 17:50.530
it may seem to be an endless sentence,

17:50.630 --> 17:52.160
it’s actually a good thing.

17:52.450 --> 17:54.760
Under the Baize Imperial Order,

17:55.480 --> 17:58.430
the curse of the Ever-Burning Wood will also fail.

17:58.960 --> 18:01.980
He won't have to endure endless burns,

18:03.400 --> 18:04.860
and he can still survive.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.770
Ridiculous.

18:14.350 --> 18:16.880
To be trapped in a confined space for eternity

18:16.910 --> 18:18.290
is worse than being alive.

18:18.290 --> 18:20.170
I am just a prisoner of convenience.

18:20.170 --> 18:21.660
What's the point?

18:22.820 --> 18:25.420
I'd rather be burned to ashes

18:27.110 --> 18:29.240
and spread it across heaven and earth.

18:32.890 --> 18:34.790
Baize Goddess.

18:39.520 --> 18:40.880
This is all your fault.

18:41.480 --> 18:43.160
It's always your fault.

18:52.400 --> 18:54.250
A life without death.

18:59.560 --> 19:01.990
You will kill him one day.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.620
Do you think you would have won

19:19.410 --> 19:21.520
just because you killed Zhou Yuanzhou?

19:21.520 --> 19:22.970
Without Divine Wood

19:23.720 --> 19:25.110
and Yao Water,

19:26.840 --> 19:29.560
there's no way to repair the Baize Token.

19:31.990 --> 19:33.750
Everything is destined.

19:37.170 --> 19:38.410
Zhao Yuanzhou.

19:39.930 --> 19:43.460
The day the malicious energy in your body goes out of control

19:44.870 --> 19:48.400
shall be the day the mortal world gets buried with you.

19:51.180 --> 19:52.430
By then,

19:54.080 --> 19:55.880
I wonder if your friends

19:57.630 --> 19:59.200
will choose to kill you

20:01.790 --> 20:03.960
or die with you?

20:40.220 --> 20:41.460
Zhao Yuanzhou.

22:23.980 --> 22:26.040
If you want to repair the Baize Token,

22:26.230 --> 22:27.820
we must use the purest and

22:27.880 --> 22:29.440
cleanest Yao Water.

22:30.350 --> 22:31.830
But now, the Yao Water

22:32.230 --> 22:35.010
has been polluted by Li Lun

22:35.080 --> 22:36.880
with the blood of Baize Goddess.

22:36.900 --> 22:39.230
I'm afraid it has lost its effectiveness.

22:41.370 --> 22:42.950
Let's put it away first.

22:44.190 --> 22:46.120
Maybe we'll find a way to purify it.

22:47.650 --> 22:49.620
Even if we can purify the Yao Water,

22:51.420 --> 22:52.800
Li Lun said

22:52.970 --> 22:54.870
the Divine Wood no longer exists.

22:55.130 --> 22:57.600
How will we repair the Baize Token?

23:01.560 --> 23:03.400
Don’t worry, Mr. Zhuo.

23:04.270 --> 23:05.590
One month later,

23:05.630 --> 23:07.890
if we still can’t repair the Baize Token,

23:08.280 --> 23:09.920
you can just kill me.

23:11.680 --> 23:13.890
I can use all my divine power

23:14.000 --> 23:16.490
to suppress Zhao Yuanzhou's malicious energy

23:16.490 --> 23:17.900
for at least a month.

23:20.880 --> 23:23.220
We just fought together.

23:23.690 --> 23:25.810
Now, you are asking someone to kill you.

23:25.810 --> 23:27.610
You demons are truly heartless.

23:28.670 --> 23:31.070
I also hope you could be equally heartless.

23:31.610 --> 23:33.300
Because people with hearts

23:34.290 --> 23:35.620
live in misery.

23:38.520 --> 23:39.880
You lack a heart.

23:40.510 --> 23:42.440
But aren't you living in agony too?

23:43.330 --> 23:44.530
Nature is merciless,

23:44.800 --> 23:46.100
and all beings suffer.

23:46.710 --> 23:48.870
Since we are born into this world,

23:50.280 --> 23:51.670
we should all live well.

23:54.630 --> 23:56.150
Zhuo is right.

23:57.410 --> 23:59.590
You mustn't always think about dying.

24:00.230 --> 24:02.630
And have you forgotten the pact between us?

24:02.690 --> 24:05.550
You still have to work for the Demon Hunting Bureau.

24:06.690 --> 24:08.550
The Baizen Token remains broken,

24:09.030 --> 24:11.430
and the Wilderness still needs to be saved.

24:12.320 --> 24:14.680
You haven't paid off your debt.

24:16.530 --> 24:17.840
It won't be that easy.

24:21.360 --> 24:22.340
Fine.

24:25.380 --> 24:26.910
But we are still enemies...

24:29.080 --> 24:30.460
but also colleagues.

24:36.190 --> 24:37.120
Thank you.

24:38.420 --> 24:39.550
What for?

24:40.040 --> 24:41.530
I'm thanking Ms. Wen Xiao.

24:42.080 --> 24:42.710
You!

25:07.320 --> 25:09.050
This is Mount Kunlun.

25:09.340 --> 25:10.720
What are you mortals

25:10.750 --> 25:11.840
doing here?

25:12.570 --> 25:14.820
It is said that the Demon Hunting Bureau and Chongwu Camp

25:14.820 --> 25:16.230
are never on good terms.

25:16.570 --> 25:17.790
But this time,

25:17.930 --> 25:19.550
we have the same goal.

25:21.040 --> 25:22.470
What exactly do you want?

25:24.350 --> 25:26.340
Arrest Zhao Yuanzhou.

25:28.430 --> 25:29.900
Zhao Yuanzhou is not here.

25:30.520 --> 25:31.940
Who said I'm not here?

25:37.230 --> 25:37.950
Wow.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.960
What's with the big reception?

25:46.190 --> 25:46.990
Guards.

25:47.870 --> 25:49.810
Arrest Zhao Yuanzhou.

25:50.460 --> 25:51.490
Mr. Zhen Mei.

25:52.220 --> 25:53.900
My godfather, Mr. Fan Ying,

25:53.920 --> 25:55.600
is your equal in rank.

25:56.150 --> 25:57.950
Chongwu Camp and Demon Hunting Bureau

25:57.950 --> 26:00.480
are neither in a hierarchical relationship.

26:00.970 --> 26:02.050
How about

26:02.690 --> 26:03.390
we leave it to

26:03.390 --> 26:06.110
a fair and open third party,

26:06.850 --> 26:08.470
the Prime Minister's representative,

26:08.470 --> 26:10.530
Ms. Pei Sijing, to make the decision?

26:17.640 --> 26:18.440
Sure.

26:24.830 --> 26:27.090
Zhao Yuanzhou shall be at the disposal of

26:29.730 --> 26:31.010
Chongwu Camp.

26:37.580 --> 26:38.630
Ms. Pei?

26:39.480 --> 26:40.380
It's okay.

26:40.640 --> 26:42.130
I am interested to see

26:42.510 --> 26:44.670
whether the Demon Hunting Bureau's prison cell

26:44.670 --> 26:47.000
is more comfortable than Chongwu Camp's.

26:47.480 --> 26:48.440
Mr. Zhen Mei.

26:50.080 --> 26:51.480
I await your punishment.

26:53.830 --> 26:54.630
Are you crazy?

26:56.770 --> 26:57.580
Don't worry.

27:21.340 --> 27:22.960
Almond buttermilk?

27:27.100 --> 27:28.020
Jiu.

27:28.190 --> 27:29.350
You've grown up.

27:29.860 --> 27:31.020
There's a lot of things

27:31.020 --> 27:33.270
Daddy shouldn't keep from you anymore.

27:33.290 --> 27:34.630
When you return to Tiandu,

27:34.630 --> 27:35.890
come and look for me.

27:35.990 --> 27:38.080
I'll take you to see your mother

27:38.110 --> 27:40.030
and tell you everything.

27:49.790 --> 27:50.580
My child.

27:51.900 --> 27:54.740
There are three thousand paths to arrive in this world,

27:54.740 --> 27:56.980
and there are thirty thousand paths for your return.

27:56.980 --> 27:59.750
As for which one is right for you,

28:00.660 --> 28:02.320
you have to find out yourself.

28:05.030 --> 28:05.830
Ying Lei.

28:12.460 --> 28:13.260
Mr. Lu Wu?

28:13.800 --> 28:15.980
I was initially stationed at Zhongshan.

28:15.980 --> 28:17.930
I heard that Mr. Ying Zhao had died,

28:17.970 --> 28:19.210
so I rushed over

28:19.420 --> 28:21.380
to guard Mount Kunlun with you.

28:21.790 --> 28:22.830
So Grandpa

28:22.970 --> 28:24.700
had already prepared for this.

28:28.320 --> 28:29.590
Thank you, Mr. Lu Wu.

28:31.480 --> 28:32.800
I'll try my best

28:33.670 --> 28:34.930
to become

28:34.950 --> 28:36.080
a good Mountain God.

28:40.330 --> 28:41.560
Mr. Lu Wu.

28:41.930 --> 28:43.660
I have a favor to ask.

28:43.690 --> 28:44.260
Oh?

28:44.280 --> 28:45.190
Tell me.

28:47.320 --> 28:49.600
Do you know how to purify Yao Water?

29:00.600 --> 29:02.280
Watch him closely.

29:02.630 --> 29:04.030
If anything goes wrong,

29:04.140 --> 29:05.530
you will be beheaded.

29:05.710 --> 29:06.220
Yes.

29:35.680 --> 29:37.680
We are to execute Zhao Yuanzhou now?

29:38.200 --> 29:40.460
It's the Prime Minister's secret order.

29:41.510 --> 29:43.370
He must be executed immediately.

29:43.560 --> 29:45.380
Then let them do it.

29:45.480 --> 29:47.610
They can't kill Zhao Yuanzhou anyway.

29:48.030 --> 29:50.160
At most, he'll suffer a little.

29:50.740 --> 29:53.110
That's why I called you here late at night.

29:54.660 --> 29:56.060
The Prime Minister knows

29:56.110 --> 29:58.510
only your Cloud Light Sword can kill him.

29:59.720 --> 30:01.560
He has specially ordered

30:02.550 --> 30:05.780
for you to execute Zhao Yuanzhou.

30:07.520 --> 30:08.430
Zhuo.

30:09.000 --> 30:10.600
The greater good is at stake.

30:10.640 --> 30:12.470
That's exactly why

30:13.740 --> 30:15.540
I shouldn't kill Zhao Yuanzhou.

30:17.790 --> 30:18.700
At least,

30:19.330 --> 30:20.410
not now.

30:21.860 --> 30:22.740
Are you crazy?

30:25.100 --> 30:25.970
Don't worry.

30:28.810 --> 30:30.970
[See you at Tiandu]

30:34.760 --> 30:35.890
Zhuo,

30:36.460 --> 30:39.120
Haven't you always wanted to kill Zhao Yuanzhou

30:40.090 --> 30:42.170
and avenge your father and brother?

30:47.420 --> 30:49.820
Zhao Yuanzhou killed my father and brother

30:50.030 --> 30:52.560
under the influence of his malicious energy.

30:53.260 --> 30:54.630
The real murderer

30:55.950 --> 30:58.880
is the malicious energy that transverses the world.

30:59.910 --> 31:01.160
And Zhao Yuanzhou

31:02.150 --> 31:03.480
happens to be the blade.

31:05.790 --> 31:07.210
These days,

31:07.420 --> 31:08.810
travelling with him,

31:10.600 --> 31:12.640
I saw a different side of him.

31:14.120 --> 31:15.400
He is indeed

31:15.720 --> 31:18.380
a compassionate and righteous demon.

31:22.260 --> 31:23.210
So,

31:24.130 --> 31:26.190
you are no longer willing to kill him?

31:26.800 --> 31:27.860
A knife's morality

31:28.260 --> 31:29.830
is determined by

31:30.300 --> 31:32.020
the hand that holds it.

31:34.930 --> 31:36.660
The two realms are in turmoil,

31:36.910 --> 31:38.830
and the Wilderness is in danger.

31:39.390 --> 31:42.650
We must repair the damaged Baize Token as soon as possible.

31:43.040 --> 31:45.070
We need Zhao Yuanzhou’s help.

31:46.550 --> 31:48.310
The Baize Token is broken?

31:50.080 --> 31:53.480
Then all the more we must execute Zhao Yuanzhou immediately.

31:55.130 --> 31:57.560
No wonder Prime Minister did not dare to risk it,

31:57.560 --> 31:59.100
and even more so for myself.

31:59.120 --> 31:59.920
Mr. Fan.

32:00.600 --> 32:01.780
Say no more.

32:01.810 --> 32:02.870
This is the Prime Minister's order.

32:02.870 --> 32:04.070
You must carry it out.

32:04.110 --> 32:05.030
Father.

32:05.060 --> 32:06.080
The Prime Minister is being unreasonable.

32:06.080 --> 32:08.140
Are you going to be unreasonable too?

32:08.840 --> 32:09.640
Xiao.

32:11.350 --> 32:13.250
Xiao, you mustn't speak recklessly about the Prime Minister.

32:13.250 --> 32:14.720
Prime Minister  has the world in his heart.

32:14.720 --> 32:16.530
How could he disregard the safety of the people

32:16.530 --> 32:18.110
and leave behind endless troubles?

32:18.110 --> 32:18.630
Fine.

32:18.990 --> 32:21.190
I'll talk to the Prime Minister myself.

32:21.250 --> 32:21.860
Wen Xiao!

32:21.880 --> 32:22.400
Xiao!

32:22.510 --> 32:23.070
Xiao!

32:23.270 --> 32:23.990
Stop her!

32:47.680 --> 32:48.730
Brother!

32:50.140 --> 32:51.460
Bullock's blood...

32:52.820 --> 32:55.340
How many demons

32:55.830 --> 32:59.160
have died in this steel cage smeared with the beast's blood?

33:35.270 --> 33:41.850
[Book of Rites]

33:47.190 --> 33:49.150
I didn't ask Mr. Torch Dragon

33:49.150 --> 33:50.380
to make me the top student in high school.

33:50.380 --> 33:51.490
I relied on my own abilities

33:51.490 --> 33:53.750
to go to the capital for the examination.

34:01.030 --> 34:04.950
You proposed to the court to rebuild the Demon Hunting Bureau.

34:05.540 --> 34:08.540
Although the Prime Minister strongly vouched for it,

34:09.159 --> 34:11.520
the Chongwu Camp is interfering.

34:11.710 --> 34:12.570
Chongwu Camp

34:12.590 --> 34:14.300
exaggerated and twisted the truth.

34:14.300 --> 34:16.159
Fortunately, the Prime Minister pleaded for us,

34:16.159 --> 34:17.449
and got us

34:17.489 --> 34:18.889
one last day of pardon.

34:48.739 --> 34:50.120
Who are you?

34:50.630 --> 34:52.030
Why are you kneeling?

34:56.469 --> 34:58.470
Prime Minister, please forgive me.

34:59.640 --> 35:02.040
I'm Wen Xiao from the Demon Hunting Bureau.

35:02.510 --> 35:04.550
I stopped your carriage

35:05.350 --> 35:06.730
because...

35:07.780 --> 35:09.910
I have something important to ask for.

35:44.120 --> 35:46.410
Thank you for your cooperation, Ms. Pei.

35:46.750 --> 35:50.280
It's thanks to you that our collaboration can be this flawless.

35:51.410 --> 35:53.390
Stall them in Sinan Water Town.

35:53.410 --> 35:54.610
Can you do it?

35:56.340 --> 35:57.310
It has to be

35:57.740 --> 35:58.960
just the right time.

35:59.130 --> 36:00.590
Three or four days will do.

36:13.280 --> 36:15.130
What did Zhen Mei offer as a deal

36:15.670 --> 36:17.540
for you to consent to being a mole?

36:20.870 --> 36:21.750
My brother.

36:23.850 --> 36:25.390
Isn't your brother...

36:27.800 --> 36:29.520
Zhen Mei spoke to me just now.

36:30.470 --> 36:31.980
He said he faked his death.

36:33.340 --> 36:34.790
He's still alive.

36:34.980 --> 36:36.640
If I ever want to see him again,

36:38.080 --> 36:39.840
I have to work for them.

36:40.600 --> 36:42.150
But you clearly know that

36:43.120 --> 36:44.180
your brother

36:45.360 --> 36:46.550
is indeed dead.

36:57.880 --> 36:59.130
I know.

37:04.240 --> 37:05.910
I used Chaotic Impermanence

37:05.960 --> 37:07.950
to let you see your brother again.

37:08.760 --> 37:10.760
Although he exists only as a puppet,

37:11.130 --> 37:13.000
you still owe me a favor.

37:13.750 --> 37:14.990
Ms. Pei,

37:15.420 --> 37:17.340
shouldn't you also help me?

37:23.390 --> 37:25.120
What do you want me to do for you?

37:26.070 --> 37:28.070
Just keep pretending to be his mole,

37:28.640 --> 37:30.510
so that I can

37:30.630 --> 37:32.830
to find out the secrets of Chongwu Camp.

37:34.100 --> 37:34.900
Okay.

37:35.990 --> 37:37.980
Should I tell Wen Xiao and Mr. Zhuo?

37:40.070 --> 37:40.860
No.

37:42.280 --> 37:43.940
You don't even trust Wen Xiao.

37:47.470 --> 37:49.910
I don't want to put her in any danger.

37:50.470 --> 37:51.530
Besides,

37:51.850 --> 37:54.300
making Wen Xiao and Zhuo angry

37:54.760 --> 37:56.400
will make our plan

37:56.760 --> 37:58.760
seem more realistic and trustable.

38:02.820 --> 38:04.280
You demon

38:06.300 --> 38:07.580
are really evil.

38:15.100 --> 38:16.900
Tomorrow, the blood moon rises.

38:17.440 --> 38:18.870
Would anything go wrong

38:19.490 --> 38:21.100
with this formation?

38:22.600 --> 38:24.450
I hope I'm not mistaken.

38:25.920 --> 38:28.490
The formation requires the help of two Mountain Gods.

38:28.490 --> 38:30.020
I've got it all figured out.

38:30.360 --> 38:32.560
To prevent someone from destroying it,

38:33.880 --> 38:35.140
when necessary,

38:35.170 --> 38:37.460
I'll let Ying Lei play it by ear.

38:38.000 --> 38:39.030
After all,

38:39.210 --> 38:42.410
even though he's young, he's still a Mountain God anyway.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.450
By the way, Sister Pei,

38:47.470 --> 38:48.600
where are you going?

38:49.250 --> 38:51.980
The Chongwu Camp is great at tracking.

38:52.530 --> 38:53.940
For safety's sake,

38:53.960 --> 38:55.530
I’ll patrol around.

38:56.630 --> 38:58.510
Ms. Pei, you're really something.

38:58.510 --> 39:00.220
You actually found me here.

39:00.640 --> 39:01.600
Who are you?

39:02.110 --> 39:03.460
Why are you here?

39:04.650 --> 39:06.590
Arrest Zhao Yuanzhou!

39:06.750 --> 39:07.790
Mr. Zhen Mei.

39:08.020 --> 39:09.670
My godfather, Mr. Fan Ying,

39:09.690 --> 39:11.200
is your equal in rank.

39:11.530 --> 39:12.610
How about

39:12.630 --> 39:13.260
we leave it to

39:13.260 --> 39:14.950
the Prime Minister's representative,

39:14.950 --> 39:16.530
Ms. Pei Sijing,

39:16.560 --> 39:17.920
to make the decision?

39:18.370 --> 39:20.630
Zhao Yuanzhou shall be at the disposal of

39:20.640 --> 39:22.260
Chongwu Camp.

39:27.450 --> 39:28.540
Ms. Pei.

39:29.560 --> 39:31.090
it's time to reel in the net.

39:40.340 --> 39:45.060
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

39:46.600 --> 39:47.760
Dream.

39:53.810 --> 39:55.340
Thank you, Ms. Pei.

39:55.540 --> 39:56.820
Otherwise,

39:56.860 --> 39:58.870
I really wouldn't know how to get out of this

39:58.870 --> 40:01.480
prison cell smeared with the beast's blood.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.230
Rumor has it that

40:04.870 --> 40:06.350
the demons captured were

40:06.520 --> 40:09.050
used for research by the mysterious advisor.

40:11.420 --> 40:12.570
Eight years ago,

40:13.130 --> 40:15.590
Li Lun and I were playing in the mortal world.

40:16.500 --> 40:18.830
One time, we took shelter in Jixin Clinic.

40:19.410 --> 40:21.070
I accidentally found out that

40:21.310 --> 40:23.570
there was a dungeon hidden underground.

40:24.260 --> 40:26.550
It's very similar to the layout here.

40:28.190 --> 40:28.900
It should also designed

40:28.900 --> 40:31.150
by this mysterious advisor.

40:35.900 --> 40:37.500
Now, we have solid evidence.

40:37.750 --> 40:39.850
I want to report it to the Prime Minister.

40:39.850 --> 40:42.060
I seldom have guests here.

40:48.390 --> 40:50.020
Stop playing tricks.

40:50.790 --> 40:52.540
I know who you are.

40:52.800 --> 40:55.760
Take off that ugly mask of yours,

40:56.440 --> 40:58.320
Mr. Wen Zongyu.

41:00.390 --> 41:01.600
You've guessed it.

41:03.040 --> 41:04.700
During the case of the plague,

41:05.000 --> 41:07.880
you gave yourself a reason to appear at Sinan Water Town.

41:07.880 --> 41:09.180
I'm Wen Zongyu.

41:09.600 --> 41:11.150
Nice to meet you, Mr. Zhuo.

41:11.170 --> 41:12.370
Right after you left,

41:12.820 --> 41:15.240
a mysterious man took Zhuo away.

41:20.920 --> 41:22.120
Just because of this?

41:23.920 --> 41:25.390
Eight years ago,

41:26.620 --> 41:29.150
you were the doctor in charge of Jixin Clinic.

41:31.280 --> 41:34.110
In the secret dungeon under Jixin Clinic,

41:34.140 --> 41:36.590
all the dirty deeds there

41:37.510 --> 41:39.110
were also your doing, right?

42:04.130 --> 42:06.100
I underestimated you,

42:07.080 --> 42:08.670
Zhao Yuanzhou.

42:10.990 --> 42:12.330
What do you want to do

42:12.900 --> 42:14.160
with all these demons?

42:15.600 --> 42:17.980
It's only natural to kill them if they're caught.

42:17.980 --> 42:20.580
But that's not my only wish.

42:20.830 --> 42:22.710
I hope one day

42:23.550 --> 42:26.060
I'll kill all the demons in the world.

42:27.130 --> 42:28.380
Zhao Yuanzhou.

42:28.510 --> 42:30.510
I've always wanted your inner core.

42:31.010 --> 42:34.390
I didn't expect you to come here in person today.

42:35.310 --> 42:37.350
You're just a mere mortal.

42:38.200 --> 42:40.610
How dare you take my inner core?

42:41.170 --> 42:43.370
Aren't you afraid of hurting yourself?

42:43.600 --> 42:45.460
Indeed, it's a challenging task.

42:46.620 --> 42:49.960
But I heard as long as the demon's five senses are sealed,

42:50.570 --> 42:53.370
its inner core will automatically leave its body.

42:54.040 --> 42:56.280
I have affected your sense of taste,

42:57.420 --> 42:58.010
smell,

42:58.800 --> 42:59.630
sight,

43:00.100 --> 43:00.980
and voice.

43:01.510 --> 43:03.640
Haven't you noticed?

43:10.870 --> 43:12.380
So it was him.

43:14.180 --> 43:15.310
What?

43:15.770 --> 43:16.540
Who is it?

43:18.270 --> 43:19.470
Ms. Pei.

43:20.890 --> 43:23.150
Looks like you're destined to be cheated

43:23.660 --> 43:26.210
by your brother for the rest of your life.
